      "text": "Jacob2 magnifies office, that blood might not come upon his garments, Jacob 1:19 (2:2–3). Alma1 confers office of high priest upon Alma2, Mosiah 29:42. Alma2 retains office of high priest, Alma 4:18. Melchizedek received office of high priesthood according to holy order of God, Alma 13:18. robbers held in office at head of government, Hel. 7:5. office of angels’ ministry is to call men to repentance, Moro. 7:31.",
